cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "EMISense: a dataset and on-device classifier of electromagnetic interference sources"
abstract: >-
  2,295 labelled 100 ms captures of electromagnetic interference from 26
  household sources and an EMI attack emitter, recorded with a coil,
  transistor and envelope-detector front end on an ESP32 at 20 kSa/s, with
  the acquisition and classification firmware, the analysis and training
  code, and the hardware description.
